{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And this is the matter of the release.</b> From here our Rabbis said: one who repays his fellow on the shemittah year etc. And likewise with the murderer it is written וזה דבר הרוצח — one who was exiled to a city of refuge must say, 'I am a murderer.' And in the Yerushalmi it concludes: thus you learn from here — one who is learned in one tractate and they call him [as though he were learned] in two, must say regarding the one alone, 'I am learned.'"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:58.973181219Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}